msgid "Assign {context} to {count} selected records? Existing associations will be replaced; recorded times, types and content will not change."
msgstr "將 {context} 關聯到選取的 {count} 筆記錄？既有關聯將被取代，時間、類型和內容不會改變。"

msgid "Assistant"
msgstr "助手"

msgid "Attendance counts dates with positive worked hours, including scheduled days off. Planned work follows the weekly schedule and enabled regional public holidays. This is not an attendance rate."
msgstr "實際出勤按有正工時的日期計數，包含休息日出勤。計畫工作按每週安排及已啟用地區的假日計算。這不是出勤率。"

