msgstr "返回帳戶"

msgid "Back to login"
msgstr "返回登入"

msgid "Back up your database regularly to protect your local work logs, reports, settings, and account data."
msgstr "定期備份資料庫，保護本機工作記錄、報表、設定及帳戶資料。"

msgid "Background image"
msgstr "背景圖片"

msgid "Background tasks are taking longer than expected. You can keep waiting or confirm a forced exit."
msgstr "背景工作耗時較長。您可以繼續等待，或確認強制結束。"

