msgstr "變化"

msgid "Change avatar"
msgstr "更換頭像"

msgid "Change password"
msgstr "變更密碼"

msgid "Changes apply to new records. Existing records keep their saved name and accounting category."
msgstr "修改僅用於新記錄。既有記錄保留儲存時的名稱和統計口徑。"

msgid "Changes apply to new records. Existing records keep their saved work arrangement name."
msgstr "變更僅用於新紀錄。既有紀錄保留儲存時的工作方式名稱。"

msgid "Changing password will reset the recovery key."
msgstr "變更密碼會重設復原金鑰。"

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "檢查更新"

msgid "Check records"
msgstr "檢查記錄"

msgid "Checking for updates..."
msgstr "正在檢查更新..."

msgid "Choose a backup destination different from the active database."
msgstr "請選擇不同於目前資料庫的備份位置。"

msgid "Choose a compatible SQLite database backup, not the active database or a personal cloud backup archive. No replacement was performed."
msgstr "請選擇相容的 SQLite 資料庫備份，而非目前資料庫或個人雲端備份封存檔。尚未執行替換。"

msgid "Choose a holiday region to calculate planned work and automatic goals."
msgstr "請選擇假日地區，以計算計畫工作與自動目標。"

msgid "Choose a local SQLite backup (.db, .sqlite or .sqlite3), not a CSV or personal cloud archive. WorkLogger checks a copy before replacement, keeps the current files, then opens sign-in for an account from the backup."
msgstr "選擇本機 SQLite 資料庫備份（.db、.sqlite 或 .sqlite3），而非 CSV 或個人雲端備份封存檔。軟體會先檢查備份副本，保留目前檔案後再取代。完成後請使用備份中的帳戶登入。"

msgid "Choose a login ID and password."
msgstr "設定登入 ID 和密碼。"

msgid "Choose a split time strictly inside the recorded interval."
msgstr "請選擇記錄時段內的拆分時間，不能選擇開始或結束時間。"

msgid "Choose a valid PNG, JPEG, GIF or WebP background image."
msgstr "請選擇有效的 PNG、JPEG、GIF 或 WebP 背景圖片。"

msgid "Choose a valid PNG, JPEG, WebP, or BMP image."
msgstr "請選擇有效的 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 BMP 圖片。"

msgid "Choose a valid timesheet period and format."
msgstr "請選擇有效的工時表期間與格式。"

msgid "Choose an earlier end time to save this timer."
msgstr "請選擇更早的結束時間以儲存此計時。"

msgid "Choose an image smaller than 10 MB and 20 million pixels."
msgstr "請選擇不超過10 MB及2000萬像素的圖片。"

msgid "Choose an image with a long edge of at least 1280 pixels and a short edge of at least 720 pixels."
msgstr "請選擇長邊至少 1280 像素、短邊至少 720 像素的圖片。"

msgid "Choose backup..."
msgstr "選擇備份…"

msgid "Choose custom color"
msgstr "選擇自訂色彩"

msgid "Choose one action"
msgstr "請選擇一種操作"

msgid "Choose your own login ID; an email address is not required."
msgstr "自行設定登入 ID，無需填寫電子郵件。"

