msgstr "雲端儲存驗證失敗。請檢查憑證與權限。"

msgid "Cloud backup failed. Check the network, storage service, and available space."
msgstr "雲端備份失敗。請檢查網路、儲存服務與可用空間。"

msgid "Cloud backup is disabled for this installation."
msgstr "此安裝已停用雲端備份。"

