msgid "Text processing is not ready. Check AI settings."
msgstr "文字處理尚未就緒，請檢查 AI 設定。"

msgid "Text processing is unavailable. Saved preferences are retained."
msgstr "文字處理無法使用，已儲存的設定會保留。"

msgid "Text processing source: external model."
msgstr "文字處理來源：外部模型。"

msgid "The CSV file exceeds the supported size or row limit."
msgstr "CSV 檔案超出支援的大小或列數限制。"

msgid "The ID or password is incorrect."
msgstr "ID 或密碼不正確。"

msgid "The account's remembered session was revoked, but its device file could not be removed. Sign in manually and check storage permissions."
msgstr "已撤銷此帳戶的記住登入憑證，但無法移除裝置上的工作階段檔案。請手動登入並檢查儲存權限。"

msgid "The application log could not be opened. Check the log directory and its permissions, then retry. Diagnostics can be copied even when no log file was created."
msgstr "無法開啟應用程式日誌。請檢查日誌目錄及其存取權限，然後重試。即使尚未建立日誌檔案，也可以複製診斷資訊。"

msgid "The backup exceeds the supported size limit."
msgstr "備份超過支援的大小限制。"

msgid "The backup passphrase is incorrect or the encrypted backup was modified."
msgstr "備份密語錯誤，或加密備份已遭修改。"

msgid "The cloud backup is missing, damaged, or uses an unsupported format. Local data has not been replaced."
msgstr "雲端備份不存在、已損毀或格式不受支援。本機資料未被取代。"

msgid "The cloud version changed. Review the latest backup and explicitly confirm an overwrite."
msgstr "雲端版本已變更。請核對最新備份並明確確認覆寫。"

msgid "The data directory is unavailable."
msgstr "資料目錄無法使用。"

msgid "The database contains conflicting account identifiers or record links. Keep the original file and resolve these conflicts on a copy."
msgstr "資料庫包含衝突的帳戶識別碼或記錄關聯。請保留原始檔案，在副本中解決這些衝突。"

msgid "The database could not be read. The original files have been retained. Restore a verified backup using the database recovery instructions."
msgstr "無法讀取資料庫，原始檔案已保留。請按照資料庫復原說明復原經過驗證的備份。"

msgid "The database is ready. Original files are kept in:\n{path}\n\nContinue to account setup or sign-in."
msgstr "資料庫已準備就緒。原始檔案保留在：\n{path}\n\n接下來請設定帳戶或登入。"

msgid "The database is temporarily in use. Finish other database operations or close tools accessing it, then retry. Do not delete journal or lock files."
msgstr "資料庫暫時被佔用。請等待其他資料庫操作完成，或關閉正在存取資料庫的工具，然後重試。不要刪除日誌檔案或鎖定檔案。"

msgid "The deployment configuration could not be read, so registration and external sign-in are disabled. No initial account is available. Ask your administrator to correct worklogger.config.json, then retry; do not delete the database."
msgstr "無法讀取部署設定，註冊與外部身分登入已停用，且目前沒有可用的初始帳戶。請聯絡管理員修正 worklogger.config.json 後重試，不要刪除資料庫。"

msgid "The draft could not be read. Your saved note is shown. Reload to discard the unreadable draft."
msgstr "無法讀取草稿，目前顯示已儲存的筆記。重新載入可捨棄無法讀取的草稿。"

msgid "The file contains conflicting records for the same date."
msgstr "檔案中存在同一日期的衝突記錄。"

msgid "The historical break must fit inside the recorded interval."
msgstr "歷史休息必須完整位於紀錄區間內。"

msgid "The indicated location is read-only. Restore write access, then retry. A database also needs a writable directory for journal and lock files. Do not delete existing database files."
msgstr "所示位置為唯讀。請恢復寫入權限後重試。資料庫所在目錄也需要允許建立日誌檔案與鎖定檔案。不要刪除現有資料庫檔案。"

msgid "The latest 50 saved versions are retained. Restoring creates a new version."
msgstr "保留最近 50 個已儲存版本。還原將建立新版本。"

msgid "The local account changed. Sign in again before continuing."
msgstr "本機帳戶已變更。請重新登入後繼續。"

msgid "The model exceeds the supported download size limit."
msgstr "模型超過支援的下載大小上限。"

msgid "The model returned no content. Please try again."
msgstr "模型未傳回內容，請重試。"

msgid "The operation could not be completed. Please try again."
msgstr "無法完成操作，請重試。"

msgid "The password must contain at least {length} characters."
msgstr "密碼至少需要 {length} 個字元。"

msgid "The password must not exceed 1024 UTF-8 bytes."
msgstr "密碼不得超過 1024 個 UTF-8 位元組。"

msgid "The passwords do not match."
msgstr "兩次輸入的密碼不一致。"

msgid "The records have changed. Reload them before undoing this operation."
msgstr "紀錄已發生變更，復原前請重新載入。"

msgid "The report has not loaded. Reload it before continuing."
msgstr "報表尚未載入，請重新載入後繼續。"

msgid "The required file or storage location is unavailable. Check that the drive is connected and the directory is accessible, then retry."
msgstr "所需檔案或儲存位置無法使用。請確認磁碟已連接，且目錄可以存取，然後重試。"

msgid "The saved report is no longer available. Reload the reports and try again."
msgstr "已儲存的報表已無法使用。請重新載入報表後再試。"

msgid "The saved sign-in configuration cannot be read. Replace the local Google and Microsoft registrations? The original encrypted file will be retained as a backup."
msgstr "無法讀取已儲存的登入設定。是否取代本機 Google 和 Microsoft 應用程式註冊設定？原加密檔案將保留為備份。"

msgid "The selected backup will replace the active database. Existing database files will be retained. Sign in with an account from the backup after recovery. Continue?"
msgstr "所選備份將替換目前資料庫，現有資料庫檔案會保留。復原後請使用備份中的帳戶登入。是否繼續？"

msgid "The selected context is too large. Choose a shorter period or exclude optional content."
msgstr "所選上下文過大。請選擇更短的時間範圍或排除選用內容。"

msgid "The selected model's context limit is too small for text processing."
msgstr "所選模型的上下文上限過小，無法用於文字處理。"

msgid "The selected project or work item is unavailable for new records."
msgstr "所選專案或工作項目不可用於新紀錄。"

msgid "The storage certificate could not be verified. Check the endpoint and trusted certificate configuration."
msgstr "無法驗證儲存服務的憑證。請檢查服務位址與受信任憑證設定。"

msgid "The stored credential cannot be decrypted on this device. Enter it again; existing work records are unaffected."
msgstr "無法在此裝置上解密已存憑證。請重新輸入，現有工作記錄不受影響。"

msgid "The system clock differs from the sign-in provider. Check your device date and time, then try again."
msgstr "系統時間與登入提供者不一致。請檢查裝置的日期和時間後重試。"

msgid "The timesheet contains content that cannot be represented in this format. The destination file is unchanged."
msgstr "工時表含有此格式無法表示的內容，目標檔案未改變。"

msgid "The user ID cannot contain invisible formatting or control characters."
msgstr "使用者 ID 不能包含不可見的格式字元或控制字元。"

msgid "The user account is no longer available."
msgstr "該使用者帳戶已無法使用。"

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主題"

msgid "There is not enough free space to download this model. Free disk space and try again."
msgstr "沒有足夠的可用空間下載此模型。請釋放磁碟空間後重試。"

msgid "There is not enough space on the affected drive, or its storage quota is exhausted. Free space without deleting database or recovery files, then retry."
msgstr "相關磁碟空間不足，或儲存配額已用盡。請釋放空間後重試，不要刪除資料庫或復原檔案。"

msgid "These records do not have compatible time-zone information. Choose entire-record replacement or cancel."
msgstr "這些記錄的時區資訊不相容。請選擇取代整筆記錄，或取消操作。"

msgid "These times overlap another record or the active timer. Choose a different period."
msgstr "該時段與其他記錄或正在執行的計時重疊，請選擇其他時段。"

msgid "This ID is already in use. Choose a different ID."
msgstr "此 ID 已被使用，請選擇其他 ID。"

msgid "This analytics export is too large. Choose a shorter period; the destination file is unchanged."
msgstr "本次統計匯出過大。請選擇較短的期間；原有目標檔案保持不變。"

msgid "This authorization response is invalid. Return to WorkLogger."
msgstr "此授權回應無效。請返回 WorkLogger。"

msgid "This database has no accounts, and self-registration is disabled. Ask your administrator to provide a prepared database or temporarily allow initial account setup in worklogger.config.json, then retry."
msgstr "此資料庫沒有帳戶，且自助註冊已關閉。請聯絡管理員提供已設定帳戶的資料庫，或在 worklogger.config.json 中暫時允許初始帳戶設定，然後重試。"

msgid "This database version or structure is not supported. Keep the original file and use a compatible version to export your data."
msgstr "不支援此資料庫版本或結構。請保留原始檔案，使用相容版本匯出資料。"

msgid "This entry type changed or is no longer available. Reload the types and try again."
msgstr "該記錄類型已變更或無法使用。請重新載入類型後再試。"

msgid "This historical deduction cannot be represented in whole minutes. The original record is unchanged."
msgstr "這項歷史扣除無法用整分鐘表示，原紀錄未改變。"

msgid "This identity is already linked to an account."
msgstr "此身分已連結至帳戶。"

msgid "This image or animation exceeds the background size limits. Choose a smaller file or fewer frames."
msgstr "此圖片或動畫超過背景大小限制，請選擇較小的檔案或影格較少的動畫。"

msgid "This item has changed. Reload it before saving; your input has been retained."
msgstr "此項目已發生變更。儲存前請重新載入，輸入內容已保留。"

msgid "This model is in use by another user and cannot be deleted."
msgstr "此模型正被其他使用者使用，無法刪除。"

msgid "This note was changed in another editor. Reload it before trying again. Your changes have been retained."
msgstr "此筆記已在其他編輯視窗中變更。請重新載入後再試。您的修改已保留。"

msgid "This record changed elsewhere. Reload it before saving. Your changes have been retained."
msgstr "該記錄已在其他位置修改，請重新載入後儲存。您的修改已保留。"

msgid "This record is too large for reversible editing. Existing records are unchanged."
msgstr "此紀錄超過可復原編輯的大小限制，現有紀錄未改變。"

msgid "This report changed elsewhere. Reload the history before deleting it."
msgstr "此報表已在其他位置修改。請重新載入歷史清單後再刪除。"

msgid "This report is too large to save. Your current content has been retained."
msgstr "此報表過大，無法儲存。目前內容已保留。"

msgid "This server does not support the conditional writes required for safe backups."
msgstr "此伺服器不支援安全備份所需的條件式寫入。"

msgid "This sign-in configuration is managed outside the application."
msgstr "此登入設定由應用程式外部管理。"

msgid "This text exceeds the selected model's context limit. Shorten it and try again."
msgstr "內容超過所選模型的上下文限制。請縮短後重試。"

msgid "This timer has reached your reminder duration."
msgstr "此計時已達到設定的提醒時長。"

msgid "This timesheet is too large. Choose a shorter period; the destination file is unchanged."
msgstr "此工時表過大，請選擇更短的期間。目標檔案未改變。"

msgid "This work arrangement changed or is no longer available. Reload the arrangements and try again."
msgstr "此工作方式已變更或無法使用。請重新載入後再試。"

msgid "This work timer has reached your continuous-work reminder duration."
msgstr "此工作計時已達到連續工作提醒時長。"

msgid "Thu"
msgstr "四"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "時間"

msgid "Time outside the new period is preserved. Existing records may be split."
msgstr "保留新時段以外的時間，必要時會自動拆分原記錄。"

msgid "Time record"
msgstr "時間記錄"

msgid "Time records"
msgstr "時間記錄"

msgid "Time replacement preview"
msgstr "時段取代預覽"

msgid "Time zone: {zone}"
msgstr "時區：{zone}"

msgid "Timer reminder"
msgstr "計時提醒"

msgid "Timesheet"
msgstr "工時表"

msgid "Timesheet exported."
msgstr "工時表已匯出。"

msgid "Title"
msgstr "標題"

msgid "To"
msgstr "結束日期"

msgid "Today"
msgstr "今天"

msgid "Too many attempts. Try again in {seconds} seconds, or use another sign-in method."
msgstr "嘗試次數過多。請在 {seconds} 秒後重試，或使用其他登入方式。"

msgid "Too many records. Choose a shorter date range to calculate complete totals."
msgstr "記錄過多。請選擇較短的日期範圍，以計算完整合計。"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "總計"

msgid "Total hours"
msgstr "總工時"

msgid "Total: {hours:.1f}h"
msgstr "總計：{hours:.1f}h"

msgid "Traditional Chinese"
msgstr "繁體中文"

msgid "Training"
msgstr "培訓"

msgid "Tue"
msgstr "二"

msgid "Two days off per week"
msgstr "雙休"

msgid "UTC offset"
msgstr "UTC 偏移"

msgid "Unable to apply this record change. Existing records are unchanged."
msgstr "無法套用此紀錄變更，現有紀錄未改變。"

msgid "Unable to back up the database. Check the destination and available disk space."
msgstr "無法備份資料庫，請檢查目標位置與可用磁碟空間。"

msgid "Unable to check for updates. Check your network connection and try again."
msgstr "無法檢查更新，請檢查網路連線後重試。"

msgid "Unable to check records. Existing data is unchanged."
msgstr "無法檢查記錄。現有資料未變更。"

msgid "Unable to complete the AI request. Check your model settings and try again."
msgstr "無法完成 AI 請求，請檢查模型設定後重試。"

msgid "Unable to contact the sign-in provider. Check your network connection and try again."
msgstr "無法連線至登入服務。請檢查網路連線後重試。"

msgid "Unable to delete the note. Your saved data has been retained."
msgstr "無法刪除筆記。已儲存的資料保持不變。"

msgid "Unable to delete the report. Your saved data has been retained."
msgstr "無法刪除報表，已儲存的資料仍然保留。"

msgid "Unable to export the file. Check the destination and write permissions."
msgstr "無法匯出檔案，請檢查目標位置與寫入權限。"

msgid "Unable to export the timesheet. The destination file and report draft are unchanged."
msgstr "無法匯出工時表，目標檔案與報表草稿未改變。"

msgid "Unable to import the file. Check its format and contents."
msgstr "無法匯入檔案，請檢查檔案格式與內容。"

msgid "Unable to load daily notes. Your saved data has been retained."
msgstr "無法載入每日便箋，已儲存的資料未被更改。"

msgid "Unable to load data. Please try again."
msgstr "無法載入資料，請重試。"

msgid "Unable to load or save project data. Your input has been retained."
msgstr "無法載入或儲存專案資料，輸入內容已保留。"

msgid "Unable to load or save the background. The previous background has been retained."
msgstr "無法載入或儲存背景，已保留原背景。"

msgid "Unable to load the selected model. Check available memory or choose a smaller model."
msgstr "無法載入所選模型。請檢查可用記憶體或選擇較小的模型。"

msgid "Unable to load the user profile. Please try again."
msgstr "無法載入使用者資料，請再試一次。"

msgid "Unable to load timesheet records. Your report draft is unchanged."
msgstr "無法載入工時表紀錄，報表草稿未改變。"

msgid "Unable to obtain the model. Check the source file or download connection."
msgstr "無法取得模型，請檢查來源檔案或下載連線。"

msgid "Unable to open the browser. Check your default browser and try again."
msgstr "無法開啟瀏覽器。請檢查預設瀏覽器設定後重試。"

msgid "Unable to open the data directory."
msgstr "無法開啟資料目錄。"

msgid "Unable to open the data directory. Use the database path shown above."
msgstr "無法開啟資料目錄，請使用上方顯示的資料庫路徑。"

msgid "Unable to open the directory. Use the file path shown above."
msgstr "無法開啟目錄。請使用上方顯示的檔案路徑。"

msgid "Unable to read the model file. Check its access permissions."
msgstr "無法讀取模型檔案，請檢查存取權限。"

msgid "Unable to restore the database. Select a valid SQLite backup."
msgstr "無法復原資料庫，請選擇有效的 SQLite 備份。"

msgid "Unable to restore the timer. Discard it to start a new record."
msgstr "無法恢復計時狀態，請放棄舊計時後開始新記錄。"

msgid "Unable to save settings. Please try again."
msgstr "無法儲存設定，請重試。"

msgid "Unable to save sign-in configuration. Check access to the local configuration directory."
msgstr "無法儲存登入設定。請檢查本機設定目錄的存取權限。"

msgid "Unable to save the note. Your changes have been retained."
msgstr "無法儲存便箋，編輯內容已保留。"

msgid "Unable to save the recovery copy or remove invalid records. Existing database records are unchanged. Choose a new JSON file in a writable private folder."
msgstr "無法儲存復原副本或移除異常記錄。資料庫中的現有記錄未變更。請在可寫入的私密資料夾中選擇新的 JSON 檔案。"

msgid "Unable to save the recovery key. Choose another location and try again."
msgstr "無法儲存復原金鑰。請選擇其他位置後重試。"

msgid "Unable to save the report. Your changes have been retained."
msgstr "無法儲存報表，您的編輯內容已保留。"

msgid "Unable to save the temporary password. Choose another location and try again."
msgstr "無法儲存臨時密碼。請選擇其他位置後重試。"

msgid "Unable to save the work log. Your changes have been retained."
msgstr "無法儲存工作記錄，您的修改已保留。"

msgid "Unable to save your display name. Your input has been retained."
msgstr "無法儲存顯示名稱，您的輸入已保留。"

msgid "Unable to search records. Your filters have been retained."
msgstr "無法檢索紀錄，篩選條件已保留。"

msgid "Unable to sign in with this provider. Please try again."
msgstr "無法透過此服務登入，請重試。"

msgid "Unable to start WorkLogger. Check the application log for details."
msgstr "無法啟動 WorkLogger，請查看應用程式日誌以了解詳情。"

msgid "Unable to update automatic recording state. Your saved data has been retained."
msgstr "無法更新自動記錄狀態。已儲存的資料已保留。"

msgid "Unable to update entry types. Your records have not changed."
msgstr "無法更新記錄類型。您的記錄未變更。"

msgid "Unable to update saved sign-in information."
msgstr "無法更新已儲存的登入資訊。"

msgid "Unable to update work arrangements. Your records have not changed."
msgstr "無法更新工作方式。您的紀錄未變更。"

msgid "Unclassified"
msgstr "未分類"

msgid "Unconfirmed time change"
msgstr "時間變更待確認"

msgid "Undo"
msgstr "復原"

msgid "Undo latest record change"
msgstr "復原最近的紀錄變更"

msgid "Undo project associations for {count} records from {start} to {end}?"
msgstr "復原 {start} 至 {end} 的 {count} 筆記錄的專案關聯？"

msgid "Undo the latest record change for {date}, {start} - {end}? This does not restart a timer."
msgstr "復原 {date}、{start} - {end} 的最近紀錄變更？這不會重新開始計時。"

msgid "Undo the replacement and restore the previous records?"
msgstr "要復原此次取代並還原原有記錄嗎？"

msgid "Unencrypted backup"
msgstr "未加密備份"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "未知錯誤"

msgid "Unlink"
msgstr "解除連結"

msgid "Unlinked"
msgstr "未關聯"

msgid "Unreadable records are not skipped. Save their original values before removing them from this account."
msgstr "系統不會略過無法讀取的記錄。請先儲存原始資料，再從本帳戶移除異常記錄。"

msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "未儲存的變更"

msgid "Unsaved edits to this report will also be discarded."
msgstr "對該報表尚未儲存的修改也將被放棄。"

msgid "Update available: {version}"
msgstr "有可用更新：{version}"

msgid "Update check is not configured."
msgstr "更新檢查尚未設定。"

msgid "Upload backup"
msgstr "上傳備份"

msgid "Upload image"
msgstr "上傳圖片"

msgid "Use a backup passphrase between 12 and 1024 characters."
msgstr "備份密語長度應為 12～1024 個字元。"

msgid "Use a single-line display name without control characters."
msgstr "顯示名稱必須為單行，且不能包含控制字元。"

msgid "Use a web proxy for this application."
msgstr "為此應用程式使用網頁代理。"

msgid "Use an S3 session token"
msgstr "使用 S3 工作階段權杖"

msgid "Use an application registration supplied by your distributor or administrator. This is not your account password."
msgstr "使用發行方或管理員提供的應用程式註冊資訊。這裡不是帳戶密碼。"

msgid "Use default avatar"
msgstr "使用預設頭像"

msgid "Use external model"
msgstr "使用外部模型"

msgid "Use model"
msgstr "使用模型"

msgid "Use this key to reset a forgotten password. It is not your sign-in password. Keep it private."
msgstr "忘記密碼時，可用此金鑰重設密碼。它不是日常登入密碼，請妥善保管，不要分享給他人。"

msgid "User"
msgstr "使用者"

msgid "User administration"
msgstr "使用者管理"

msgid "User created, but the account list could not be refreshed."
msgstr "使用者已建立，但帳戶清單無法重新整理。"

msgid "User created."
msgstr "使用者已建立。"

msgid "User deleted."
msgstr "使用者已刪除。"

msgid "User guide"
msgstr "使用指南"

msgid "User updated."
msgstr "使用者已更新。"

